OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'utterly against'
OL,4,A400-home development
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor has said he is prepared to
OL,7,Ffight "tooth and nail" against plans to
OL,8,Fbuild hundreds of homes opposite a
OL,9,Fschool in Leicestershire.
OL,11,FBarratt Redrow announced plans to
OL,12,Fcreate a 400-home development off
OL,13,FMeadow Lane in Whitwick, near
OL,14,FCoalville, opposite The Castle Rock
OL,15,FSchool.
OL,17,FMichael Wyatt, deputy Leader of North
OL,18,FWest Leicestershire District Council,
OL,19,Fsaid residents are "completely and
OL,20,Futterly against" the plans.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
