OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'utterly against'
OL,4,A400-home development
OL,5,
OL,6,FKate Pryor, planning manager at Barratt
OL,7,FRedrow, said the company had "worked
OL,8,Fhard" to identify community benefits
OL,9,Fthat could be delivered alongside the
OL,10,Fnew homes.
